---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Free Workflow Toolkit and Agency Templates" description="Explore free agency workflow blueprint downloads, the workflow builder, onboarding checklist and automation guides.">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">The resource shelf</span><h1>Repeatable work starts with <span class="gradient">a tested plan.</span></h1><p>Use the free builder, inspect sample output and download agency workflow blueprint templates. These are documented starting points; n8n scaffolds require configuration and testing.</p></div>
  <div class="cards" style="padding-bottom:45px">
    <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">✓</div><h3>Agency workflow templates</h3><p>Free blueprints for client intake, lead routing, reporting, content approvals and support triage.</p><a class="text-link" href="/templates/">Browse templates →</a></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">↗</div><h3>Sample workflow output</h3><p>Inspect the steps, safeguards, test cases and downloadable source blueprint.</p><a class="text-link" href="/sample/">View sample →</a></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">◇</div><h3>AI workflow generator</h3><p>Uses a server endpoint when the AI provider is configured, with a deterministic fallback.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ai-builder/">Open generator →</a></article>
  </div>
  <div class="banner" style="margin-bottom:75px"><div><h2>Need help adapting a workflow?</h2><p>Describe the process and request a scoped workflow audit.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services/">Request an audit ↗</a></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>